### 1. 회원가입 성공 → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shoplab.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678"
}

### 2. 같은 이메일로 다시 → 409 DUPLICATE_EMAIL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shoplab.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "name": "홍길동"
}

### 3. 잘못된 입력 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wrong-email",
  "password": "1234",
  "name": "홍"
}

### 4. 로그인 성공 → 200, accessToken 발급
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shoplab.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 5. 내 정보 조회 (4번 토큰 자동 사용) → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 6. 토큰 없이 내 정보 조회 → 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/me

### 7. 비밀번호 틀림 → 401 INVALID_LOGIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shoplab.com",
  "password": "Wrong1234!"
}